#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in "
"integrating quantum and high-performance computing, and receive a badge "
"through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Passe un examen de 20 questions sur le site IBM Training pour tester tes "
"compétences en intégration du quantique et du calcul haute performance, et "
"reçois un badge via Credly."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Integrating quantum and high-performance computing"
msgstr "Examen | Intégration du quantique et du calcul haute performance"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Examen et badge {#exam-and-badge}"

