#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Enquête post-cours {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing the \"Integrating quantum and high-performance"
" computing\" course by IBM&reg;!\n"
msgstr ""
"Félicitations pour avoir terminé le cours « Intégration du quantique et du "
"calcul haute performance » par IBM&reg; !\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Teste tes connaissances {#test-your-knowledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button"
" below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for "
"Integrating quantum and high-performance computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Après avoir complété les lectures et activités de ce cours, clique sur le "
"bouton ci-dessous pour accéder à IBM Training, où tu peux passer l'examen de"
" badge pour l'intégration du quantique et du calcul haute performance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly"
" to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be "
"sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'examen se compose de 20 questions et tu dois en répondre correctement au "
"moins 16 pour réussir. Après avoir obtenu un score de réussite, ton badge "
"sera automatiquement envoyé à l'adresse e-mail que tu as utilisée pour "
"t'inscrire à IBM Training.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing "
"score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr ""
"Assure-toi d'être prêt·e à passer l'examen. Si tu n'obtiens pas un score de "
"réussite en deux tentatives, l'examen devient temporairement verrouillé.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/integrating-"
"quantum-and-high-performance-computing-badge-quiz-DL46110G\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/integrating-"
"quantum-and-high-performance-computing-badge-quiz-DL46110G\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor "
"authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the "
"administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an "
"IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge"
" earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification "
"from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal "
"information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and "
"operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with "
"IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner "
"consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be "
"viewed [here.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
msgstr ""
"AVIS : IBM fait appel aux services de Credly, un sous-traitant tiers "
"autorisé par IBM et situé aux États-Unis, pour faciliter l'administration du"
" programme IBM Digital Badge. Afin de t'émettre un IBM Digital Badge, tes "
"informations personnelles (nom, adresse e-mail et badge obtenu) seront "
"partagées avec Credly. Tu recevras une notification par e-mail de Credly "
"avec les instructions pour réclamer ton badge. Tes informations personnelles"
" sont utilisées pour émettre ton badge ainsi qu'à des fins de reporting et "
"d'exploitation du programme. IBM peut partager les informations personnelles"
" collectées avec ses filiales et des tiers dans le monde entier. Elles "
"seront traitées conformément aux pratiques de confidentialité d'IBM. La "
"déclaration de confidentialité IBM peut être consultée "
"[ici.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
